@startuml
title Flow 2 - Concert programme check (Conductor)

actor "Conductor" as Cond
participant "SAM UI" as UI
participant "SAM Server" as Server

Cond -> UI: opens Sheets list
UI -> Server: GET /api/sheets?ensemble=x
Server --> UI: sheets + snapshot badges
UI --> Cond: list with COMPLETE / PLAYABLE / INCOMPLETE badges

Cond -> UI: clicks incomplete piece
UI -> Server: GET /sheets/{id}/coverage
Server -> Server: live evaluation
Server --> UI: coverage detail\n(which voices missing, score breakdown)
UI --> Cond: shows coverage detail

Cond -> UI: creates setlist
UI -> Server: POST /api/sheet-collections
Cond -> UI: adds pieces
UI -> Server: POST /collections/{id}/sheets
Server --> UI: setlist ready
@enduml